observed precision of the bin and the mean probability predicted by the
curve for its clips. Part of it is the sampling noise of the bins,
shared by every curve, so \code{top_error_excess} (the error of the curve
minus the smallest error of the flexible curves) is what the verdict
uses.
\item \code{threshold_p_tp}: the lowest score from which the curve stays at or
above \code{target} (the rule \code{"probability"} of \code{\link[=calibrated_thresholds]{calibrated_thresholds()}}),
